{"id":"vod_sn_39066","vodId":"39066","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"牙斗兽娘","name_cn":"牙斗兽娘","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/872d51f675f7a229f1a9900d836ac37e.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《牙斗兽娘》改编自村田真哉担任原案，隅田かずあさ负责作画的同名漫画，于2017年Omani 7 上的《月刊 Heros》上宣布动画化的消息，计划定档于2018年1月。动画由LIDENFILMS负责制作，于2018年1月13日起播出。平凡的大学生·野本裕也，与神秘少女·瞳相遇了。在没有人烟的废弃场，野本目击到了她变成野兽的模样，与狮子怪物展开死战的一幕。他们的真实身份，是同时拥有人类的头脑与野兽的獠牙的“兽斗士”。并且，瞳是隐藏着最强斗争本能的兽斗士“蜜獾”。兽斗士们被自古以来支配日本经济的四大财阀三门、八菱、角供、石田所雇佣，并作为其代理人展开决斗，争夺霸权。之后，野本通过再次与瞳相遇，被卷入了这些兽斗士们的炽烈战斗“牙斗”当中——。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xiaBX5e7Nh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nKeUGyMTCB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HWgRqxUJiy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q4qWRJrcvN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NSiMV21AhE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HFEXmg0hjx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RQwzXStWCX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/776D7c6uer1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Yxn5Cp9c0T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9G19Zei3YN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FZLWp3v1891/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9JbFJAgKkh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.875Z"}